# winemac.drv: Add GCMouse raw input support.
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/12566 state=opened
# This is an improved version of https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/11799 and https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/11999.

Mostly this fixes up the latter not working, because the newly created dispatch queue for use with GCMouse is not a wine thread and hence cannot really send mouse messages.

Also window lookup is skipped similar to x11 raw input and a few other minor optimizations.

~~The downside is that this has to use private APIs to turn a wine system thread into a cocoa dispatch queue, however this specific API has been stable since 10.9 and CF directly depends on it.~~
